@ref Charities (Jersey) Law 2014, Article 21(4) (src:544-550)
@export The prohibition of Article 21(4) of the Charities (Jersey) Law 2014 as a rule: a person (the entity itself, by Article 21(7), or anyone else) must not refer to an unregistered Jersey entity as a “charity” when the person knows, suspects or has reasonable grounds to suspect that it is a Jersey entity and not registered and intends to mislead or to obtain property or a financial advantage
GIVEN referrer IS A `Party to the prohibitions on expressions` @desc Who makes the reference: the entity itself or a person other than the entity (Article 21(7): the paragraph binds either)
      `the entity` IS AN Entity @desc The entity (integration point IP5); this function reads its field “is a Jersey entity”
      `the entity is a registered charity` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Whether the entity is a registered charity (integration point IP6)
      statement IS A `Statement about an entity under Articles 21 to 23` @desc The case: the awareness and the intent of the person making the reference, and the exception flag; what is said is in the event
      interp IS AN `Interpretation of Articles 21 to 25, 37 to 43 and the endnotes` @desc The reading chosen at each fork; this function reads F7.5
GIVETH A DEONTIC `Party to the prohibitions on expressions` `Act of referring to an entity`
`Art 21(4) a person must not call an unregistered Jersey entity a “charity”, with knowledge and intent` referrer `the entity` `the entity is a registered charity` statement interp MEANS
    IF   `Art 21(4) the prohibition binds the person` `the entity` `the entity is a registered charity` statement interp
    THEN PARTY referrer
         SHANT `refer to an entity as` `that it is a “charity”` anywhere itself
         HENCE FULFILLED
         LEST  BREACH BY referrer BECAUSE "Article 21(4): a person referred to a Jersey entity that is not a registered charity as a “charity”, knowing or suspecting that it is a Jersey entity and not registered, and intending to mislead or to obtain an advantage"
    ELSE FULFILLED

